<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About WAStore - Our Story & Mission</title>
  <%- include('partials/styles') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366 0%, #128C52 100%); color: white; padding: 60px 0; text-align: center; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease;">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;">About WAStore</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; opacity: 0.95;">Empowering African merchants to sell smarter on WhatsApp</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story Section -->
  <section style="padding: 80px 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center">
        <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
          <div style="animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: #333;">Our Story</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
              WAStore was born in Ogbomoso in 2026 when our founder noticed a gap in the African e-commerce market. Thousands of entrepreneurs were selling products on WhatsApp, but they lacked the tools to scale their businesses effectively.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
              We set out to build the simplest, most powerful platform for WhatsApp commerce. Today, WAStore powers over 12,000 African merchants, processing billions in transactions every month.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
              Our mission is clear: Make it easy for any African entrepreneur to build a thriving online business using the tools they already have.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1) 0%, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.05) 100%); padding: 60px; border-radius: 15px; text-align: center; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease 0.2s both;">
            <i class="fas fa-rocket" style="font-size: 5rem; color: #25D366; margin-bottom: 2rem;"></i>
            <h3 style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Made in Africa</h3>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">For Africa, by Africans who understand the market.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values Section -->
  <section style="background: white; padding: 80px 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Our Core Values</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #666;">What drives us every day</p>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
          <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1) 0%, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.05) 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 15px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease; animation-delay: 0.1s; animation-fill-mode: both;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-10px)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 10px 30px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'; this.style.boxShadow='none'">
            <i class="fas fa-lightbulb" style="font-size: 3rem; color: #25D366; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"></i>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Innovation</h3>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">We constantly innovate to solve real problems for African merchants.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
          <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1) 0%, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.05) 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 15px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease; animation-delay: 0.2s; animation-fill-mode: both;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-10px)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 10px 30px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'; this.style.boxShadow='none'">
            <i class="fas fa-handshake" style="font-size: 3rem; color: #25D366; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"></i>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Partnership</h3>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Your success is our success. We're partners in your growth journey.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
          <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1) 0%, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.05) 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 15px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease; animation-delay: 0.3s; animation-fill-mode: both;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-10px)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 10px 30px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'; this.style.boxShadow='none'">
            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="font-size: 3rem; color: #25D366; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"></i>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Trust</h3>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Security and transparency are non-negotiable in everything we do.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
          <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1) 0%, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.05) 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 15px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease; animation-delay: 0.1s; animation-fill-mode: both;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-10px)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 10px 30px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'; this.style.boxShadow='none'">
            <i class="fas fa-users" style="font-size: 3rem; color: #25D366; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"></i>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Community</h3>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">We're building a thriving community of African entrepreneurs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
          <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1) 0%, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.05) 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 15px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease; animation-delay: 0.2s; animation-fill-mode: both;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-10px)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 10px 30px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'; this.style.boxShadow='none'">
            <i class="fas fa-globe" style="font-size: 3rem; color: #25D366; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"></i>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Impact</h3>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">We measure success by the impact we create in people's lives.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
          <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1) 0%, rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.05) 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 15px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease; animation-delay: 0.3s; animation-fill-mode: both;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-10px)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 10px 30px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)'; this.style.boxShadow='none'">
            <i class="fas fa-star" style="font-size: 3rem; color: #25D366; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"></i>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Excellence</h3>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">We strive for excellence in every product we build and service we provide.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team Section -->
  <section style="padding: 80px 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Our Team</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #666;">Building the future of African commerce</p>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
          <div style="text-align: center; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease; animation-delay: 0.1s; animation-fill-mode: both;">
            <div style="width: 120px; height: 120px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366 0%, #128C52 100%); border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 3rem;">
              <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Chioma Okafor</h3>
            <p style="color: #25D366; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">CEO & Co-founder</p>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Former fintech executive with 8+ years of experience building payment systems.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
          <div style="text-align: center; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease; animation-delay: 0.2s; animation-fill-mode: both;">
            <div style="width: 120px; height: 120px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366 0%, #128C52 100%); border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 3rem;">
              <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Ade Balogun</h3>
            <p style="color: #25D366; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">CTO & Co-founder</p>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Full-stack engineer with experience scaling platforms to millions of users.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
          <div style="text-align: center; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease; animation-delay: 0.3s; animation-fill-mode: both;">
            <div style="width: 120px; height: 120px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366 0%, #128C52 100%); border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 3rem;">
              <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Zainab Ibrahim</h3>
            <p style="color: #25D366; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Head of Product</p>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Product strategist obsessed with user experience and merchant success.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366 0%, #128C52 100%); color: white; padding: 80px 0; text-align: center;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Join Us in Building the Future</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; opacity: 0.95;">Start your WAStore journey today and grow your business.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-light" style="padding: 12px 30px; font-weight: 600;" onclick="window.location.href='/auth/signup'">Get Started Free</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
